  "notes": "v17 progresses attack distance in 100 m steps and saves a native checkpoint every iteration. It starts from the v15 Stage-1 attack-capable bundle because the exact best v16 total_iter=22 policy was not saved. Each stage rehearses only the immediately previous distance, not unrelated easy and hard scenarios. Falling below 6,700 m terminates the episode, while roll above 55 degrees is strongly penalized. WEZ entry alone has little value; low ATA, stable firing, actual target damage, and controlled 400-800 m range dominate the reward. train_curriculum.py and src/dogfight are not modified.",
